  "label": "Protective Parenting",
  "description": "The image implies a protective, nurturing role for the firefighter, which is culturally associated with parental care. While the firefighter is not biologically a parent, the act of holding and protecting the baby invokes the stereotype of a parent or guardian. This is not visible in the image but is necessary to understand the emotional context of the scene.",
